          "relation": "supporting",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 147,
            "text": "theorem of_separate_bounds\n    (hw : ∀ n x, x ∈ s.domain → 0 ≤ w n x)\n    (hsmooth : ∀ n, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (f n) s.domain)\n    (hb : ∀ m : ℕ, ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∃ p q : ℕ,\n      ∀ n x, x ∈ s.domain → ∀ j : ℕ, j ≤ m →\n        ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ j (f n) x‖ ≤\n          C * s.epsilon n ^ α * s.slow n ^ p * (max 1 (s.delta x)⁻¹) ^ q * w n x) :\n    MemClass s w α f"
          }
        }
      }
    }
